            "review_title": "Review at 86 Pho Tay",
            "review_text": "Kuan\nDubai, United Arab Emirates4 contributions\n0\nAvoid if possible. 千万不要来。\nMar 2025 • Solo\nThey run this bar like a pirate boat. They will present you a lot of things you didn't order. They are also good at pretending mistake your order and present you a more expensive beer instead of your original one. All in all they will try their best to scam money out of you. I like the show and I like the atmosphere however the operational strategy is totally unacceptable. \n这家酒吧简直就是强盗，他们会强行给你上一些你根本没有点的东西，并且要你为之付费，他们也会特别故意装傻，听不懂你之前点的单，然后进而给你上更贵的酒。总而言之，他们会非常努力的来，尽可能的从你手里面骗钱，我很喜欢这里的表演以及这里的气氛，但是他们的运营策略是完全无法接受的，千万不要来。\nRead more\nWritten March 7, 2025",
