            "review_text": "David McCabe\nDarlington, United Kingdom16 contributions\n0\nPushy staff\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nWe were forced in by a pushy promoter outside because I took a picture of the place. We were placed in the worst seats and couldn’t see anything of the shows. After a while a seat became available next to us with a better view. I moved over to the table, a waitress swiftly put a reserved sign on the table. A guy come to move me and I said I’m not moving then he informed security. Luckily I’d almost finished my beer and moved on. Clearly best tables are given to Koreans because they spend money. Awful place.\nRead more\nWritten February 9, 2024",
