            "review_text": "Karla J\n3 contributions\n0\nAwful place\nFeb 2023 • Couples\nDo not go here! \nWorst experience. \nEverything is overpriced, but that would be ok if the customer service was good … which it is not! \nWe ordered a balloon and it popped as soon as it was handed to us. We complained and were told we would get another one. This one never arrived. When we tried to leave they charged us for the balloon which we never got and did not take the amount off our bill. They were very rude and it was the worst customer experience I’ve had in Vietnam \n\nOnce again, DO NOT GO HERE - I would give zero stars if I could\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 10, 2023",
