            "review_text": "mcrew2016\nNuremberg, Germany9 contributions\n3\nWorst bar in Vietnam so far\nMay 2019\nThey were catching us with a happy hour and free shots. After taking the order, suddenly the waiter said he didn’t say anything about free shots. After a long discussion they brought us a mixture with 80%water, 20% alcohol... \nthe cocktails were disgusting, the cola had no gas at all, tasted pretty watery... at the end they gave us wet tissues for washing our hand. They were charged with 5000 per person without telling us! \nAlso a huge service fee at the end of the bill without telling us. Sadly no one reads reviews before going to this pub street / walking street. I highly recommend avoiding this bar!\nRead more\nWritten May 4, 2019",
