            "review_text": "HarryStephenson1994\nBoston, United Kingdom1 contribution\n2\nShort changed\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nThe place is horribly overpriced anyway. We should have known what we were getting ourselves in for. However, when you pay 50,000 dong over the price for drinks you expect change. I had to argue with the bartender and he simply gave me 10,000 (40,000 short of the actual change. Went to the toilet and they were the most unhygienic on the strip, urine all over the floor. Would not recommend this place to anyone. In fact I would actively recommend anyone to avoid this place at all costs.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 19, 2019",
