            "review_text": "jessie v\n5 contributions\n1\nDon’t waste your time\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nthey have guys outside trying to get you inside, we saw they had a happy hour sign and sat down. We asked our waiter 2 times if the cocktails were buy 1 get 1 free and he said yes. \nThey offer you wet towels for which you have to pay in the end, without letting you know they are on the bill.\nWhen we got the bill both cocktails were on there, turned out it was buy 2 get the 3rd free but we never even received a third one or did our waiter mention it. We wanted to leave and not get a third one just a discount, because of miscommunication. They come back with a new receipt and a new cocktail, which we had said over and over we didn’t want. We got yelled at by at least 3 members by staff that we just needed to pay and leave. I’ve never seen such unprofessional staff or childish behaviour.\n\nPlease spend your money and time elsewhere.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 16, 2019",
