            "review_text": "Felix R\n2 contributions\n2\nDON'T GO THERE! We got drugged.\nJan 2019 • Friends\nMy boys and me went for a night out and stopped at the place to get some drinks. Even though they try to lure you with the happy hour: 3 beers for the price of two, the beer is still pretty expensive for Vietnam standards. They also offer balloons filled with laughing gas, a pretty popular party drug here in Vietnam and in hindsight we know that we only got a balloon filled with hot air. \nAfter the balloon we had another beer and after that point we all lost our memory. Next thing we know is how we woke up, thankfully in our apartment, with one of the worst hangovers of our lives. I'm aware that we were quite tipsy already and that alcohol can make you black out, but we really lost all memory and they definitely put roofies in our drinks. This behavior fits the strange and unfriendly behavior of the staff. And I'm not surprised by the other bad reviews here.\nAgain: DONT GO THERE!!!!\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2019",
