            "review_text": "Jasmin\n1 contribution\n0\nHorendous experience\nNov 2018 • Friends\nI don’t know even where to start with... \nMe and my friend went in and I ordered from the menu a vegetarian mexican bowl and my friend ordered the same but with chicken. Our waitress didn’t really speak English so she asked another waiter to help her and they understood our order, or so it seemed... After 45 minutes of waiting they brought my friend’s order but “my order” was some chicken dish. We said that we didn’t order it and they first fought back saying yes I did order it...why would I order meat when I said that I’m vegetarian? Then they said sorry and that my order would come in five minutes. Umm no, it came 40 minutes later. We tried to use google translate to ask them how long will the food still take and they didn’t give us an answer. We also asked for a discount and they said no... They said that it was really busy. But people who came the same time as us to the restaurant had already got their food and left ages ago. Seriously what the hell? Awful experience, we should’ve just walked away without even paying because the food wasn’t even average. Wouldn’t even give the one star if it was possible.\nRead more\nWritten November 21, 2018",
